    {
      "text": "$MRVL SVP and CTO of Optical Engineering Radha Nagarajan, at Semicon Taiwan: \n\n1. Names Europe/Japan for laser supply sourcing as examples for SiPH modules. \n\nVery interesting that Marvell's SVP had Europe in mind when giving examples of laser supply sourcing for SiPH modules. https://t.co/zB5pDH1XVC",
