    {
      "text": "Just taking a look at Leopold's Situational Awareness Q2 13F latest holdings as of June 30th:\n\n1. $SNDK - $5.674B \n2. $MU - $5.574B \n3. $BE -  $1.899B\n4. $TSM - $1.265B\n5. $NBIS - $1.232B\n6. $CRWV - $744.5M\n7. $CORZ - $665.6M\n8. $STM - $584.3M (new)\n9. $APLD - $469.0M\n10. $RIOT - https://t.co/z39L255LAu",
