    {
      "text": "I don’t want to play investor activism here:\n\nBut I hope the recent crash sends a message to $SIVE what investor base + focus really matters (not Sweden, not wireless).\n\nAs well as that they should fire whatever board member or executive gave into local media criticisms:\n\nAnd",
